<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Wednesday's 3:00 PM close, Fresh loins were $3.00-4.00 higher in very light test; butts $1.00 higher in very light test; skinned hams steady; seedless bellies $1.00-2.00 higher; lean trimmings steady to $1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light to moderate demand and very light offerings.</p>
